Third-party Web UI components in Spark 3.3.4 and 3.5.8
====================================================

Bundled under org/apache/spark/ui/static/ in lib/spark-core_2.12-*.jar.
The licenses below apply to both distributions unless a version is specified.
MIT is selected for the components offering MIT/GPL or MIT/BSD/GPL choices.
Apache-2.0 is selected for vis.js / vis-timeline; its text is in the
distribution LICENSE. Original notices in the bundled resources are retained.

